605	     * {@code '<customerCode>-M<YY>'} where {@code customerCode} is the owner's assigned
606	     * customer code and {@code YY} is the last two digits of the fiscal year of the owner's
607	     * business-day-adjusted registration date, zero-padded to two digits. The fiscal year
608	     * starts on 1 July and is named by the calendar year it ends in.
609	     *
610	     * @param customerCode     the owner's assigned customer code (e.g. {@code 'NSW-1A2B3C4D'})
611	     * @param registrationDate the owner's business-day-adjusted registration date
612	     * @return the assigned membership number (e.g. {@code 'NSW-1A2B3C4D-M27'})
