761	     * Computes the deterministic {@link #householdId household id} an existing owner belongs to,
762	     * derived from its {@link #householdKey normalized} last name and its postcode. Returns
763	     * {@code null} when the owner has no postcode (such an owner has no household), so it never
764	     * collides with a computed household id.
765	     *
766	     * @param owner the existing owner
767	     * @return the owner's household id, or {@code null} when it has no postcode
768	     */
