808	     * {@code membershipLevel} and mapped {@code locality}. Call this whenever the membership
809	     * level changes (e.g. after {@link #capMembershipLevelToHousehold}) so the segment stays
810	     * consistent with the level.
811	     *
812	     * @param ownerDto the dto whose membershipLevel and locality are already populated
813	     */
